event: text
data: {"seq":260,"ts":"2026-08-25T05:14:28.661Z","text":"httpLineUnescape 与 httpBase64decode 均有长度/边界保护，风险低。TP-Link 经典命令注入点在日期时间设置（`system(\"date ...\")`）。审计 `httpSystemToolsDateTimeInit` 及其设置处理器。\n\n","stream":false,"block":1}

