data: {"seq":322,"ts":"2026-08-25T05:15:13.710Z","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b62e4ce8f7887d94","name":"fw_get_function_source","is_error":false,"preview":"{\n \"source\": \"// addr=0x44b748 name=l2tpFormatCmd arch=mips32be size=0\\nint __fastcall l2tpFormatCmd(int a1, char *a2)\\n{\\n  size_t v2; // $v0\\n  size_t v3; // $v0\\n  size_t v4; // $v0\\n  size_t v5; // $v0\\n\\n  if ( access(\\\"/tmp/l2tpd.conf\\\", 0) )\\n    l2tpActiveCfg(a1);\\n  sprintf(a2, \\\"xl2tpd -c %s\\\", \\\"/tmp/l2tpd.conf\\\");\\n  v2 = strlen(a2);\\n  sprintf(&a2[v2], \\\" user \\\\\\\"%s\\\\\\\" password \\\\\\\"…(+491 chars)"}

