data: {"seq":449,"ts":"2026-08-25T05:16:43.486Z","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b979dd62a0bc2469","name":"fw_get_function_source","is_error":false,"preview":"{\n \"source\": \"// addr=0x443918 name=httpPwdDecode arch=mips32be size=0\\nint __fastcall httpPwdDecode(const char *a1, const char *a2, __int16 a3)\\n{\\n  int v3; // $s0\\n  int v5; // $v0\\n  bool v6; // dc\\n  _BOOL4 v7; // $v0\\n  int result; // $v0\\n  char *v9; // $v0\\n\\n  v3 = a3;\\n  if ( a3 >= word_5C21BA )\\n  {\\n    v5 = httpBase64decode(a1, (int)a2, a3);\\n    v6 = v5 <= 0;\\n    v7 = v3 < v5;\\n    …(+323 chars)"}

